Hello,

This small update contains the following fixes and tweaks:

[list]
[*] Fixed a few background fade to black issues; 
[*] Tweaked some interaction text to be more realistic; 
[*] Updated the camera location in some scenes;
[/list]

Thanks!

Larry

Hello there,

This latest update has a few key changes:

[list]
[*] Fixed the ghost focus points; 
[*] Fixed focus point for interactables; 
[*] Fixed ghost mask textures; 
[*] Fixed fire not lighting environment in nightmare;
[/list]

[img]https://i.postimg.cc/6qZjJ78h/Okinawa-Journal-04.jpg[/img]

[img]https://i.postimg.cc/jqnkJ1MJ/Okinawa-Journal-08.jpg[/img]

The game has come a long way and is almost at 1.0 for release in November!

Larry

Hello there,

This update has the following meaningful changes:

[list]
[*] Fixed volumetric fog in nightmare scene, cemetery, and moss garden; 
[*] Added animation to pushing table in catacombs; 
[*] Fixed camera angles in all scenes as if they are from a guardian angel point of view; 
[*] Fixed kitsune breaking up in blocks;
[/list]

Thanks for playing!

Larry

Hello there!

This build includes a bunch of important updates:

[list]
[*] Updated all characters to have special camera movement, eye blinks, and to face Haruki; 
[*] Tweaked virtual mouse to disappear when Haruki is busy walking; 
[*] Updated some geometry and nav mesh layouts; 
[*] Updated some narrative and interactive elements; 
[*] Added ghostly element to restaurant scene;
[*] Updated camera movement for more scenarios (such as Haruki walking);
[*] Fixed light fixture in old hotel lobby;
[*] Fixed visual aid camera movement;
[*] Added typing animation for laptop;
[*] Adding punching animation for playfulness; 
[*] Fixed some navigation issues for haruki;
[*] Updated ladder falling animation and sounds; 
[*] Updated scene transition sounds; 
[*] Updated some interactions to stand out a bit more; 
[*] Updated the look of more spirits; 
[*] Tweaked some of the scenes a little for improved camera angles; 
[*] Updated the narrative a little bit; Updated nav mesh; 
[*] Adding more interactions for end game;
[/list]

[img]https://i.postimg.cc/FzxjkR27/vlcsnap-2025-09-03-14h46m12s126.png[/img]

[img]https://i.postimg.cc/sfPPN6vs/vlcsnap-2025-09-03-14h46m41s082.png[/img]

[img]https://i.postimg.cc/25BhFTsp/vlcsnap-2025-09-03-14h46m51s164.png[/img]

Thanks for playing!

Larry

Hello there,

This smaller update contains the following additional interactions/animations:

[list]
[*] Playing piano;
[*] Playing guitar;
[*] Dancing to walkman music;
[*] Comment about a bus;
[*] Fishing;
[*] Feeding the horse;
[/list]

Also updated the look of the beach area so there is a walkway into the water. The nav mesh has been updated in several areas as well.

Thanks for playing!

Larry

Hello there!

Thanks again to everyone for all the playtest feedback. Here are the changes for this latest update:

[list]
[*] Fixed important missing phone call option with Miyu after sleeping at Haruki's home; 
[*] Fixed oarfish warning message not playing on the radio at the right time (this is a warning the end game section has started);
[*] Reproduced and fixed the saving and loading issues; 
[*] Added automatic backup handling for up to 10 saves for each slot (for now it requires manually moving files if necessary); 
[*] Added ability to view the missing interactions when hovering over Goals in the main menu (this better lets you know what you need to do, without giving things away too much); 
[*] Fixed goals and achievements not firing properly; 
[*] Updated the interactions/narratives that are associated with certain goals and achievements; 
[*] Added testing functionality for goals; 
[*] Fixed demo goals not showing up;
[/list]

[img]https://i.ibb.co/xtC2tNMm/2025-06-24-T09-57-15.png[/img]

Thanks again for playing!

Larry

Hello there,

Thanks for all the feedback so far on the playtest! It's been very helpful. Here's a list of the latest changes:

[list]
[*] Updated default frame rate to be 60;
[*] Fixed some blurry shadows;
[*] Updated early game over to have a way to load the most recent save by talking with Tsuru; 
[*] Added hints about dealing with dark spirits; 
[*] Fixed demo screenshot graphics showing up in full game in the end Newspaper scene; 
[*] Updated interactions; 
[*] Updated dialogue to include hint about pressing I key for insight; 
[*] Fixed performance issue with frame rate not locking; 
[*] Reduced shininess of objects when spirits are talking;
[*] Fixed typos; 
[*] Fixed spirit selection scene; 
[*] Fixed terrain appearance; 
[*] Fixed shiny horse and bike; 
[*] Added more objects and geometry; 
[*] Fixed castle door options; 
[*] Fixed nameplate text; 
[*] Updated some interaction options; 
[*] Fixed texture alphas not working; 
[*] Reduced scene change time a little; 
[*] Added vignette to intro cameras; 
[*] Fixed save filename issues in editor; 
[*] Minor tweaks for performance;
[/list]

Thanks again for playing!

Larry

Hello there,

This is a major update for the game. Here are the highlights:

[list]
[*]Adding extra level with timed puzzle to underground tunnel; 
[*]Fixed duplicate flashlights in underground levels;  
[*]Added new underground level props and objects; 
[*]Added basics for puzzle with crowbar;
[*]More updates to the demo levels; 
[*]Adding new level to main game; 
[*]Minor twaeks for narrative and demo;
[*]Fixed setting anti aliasing; 
[*]Fixed input device handling; Minor tweaks;
[*]Adding mouse interaction and old cheese;
[*]Fixed interaction rules; 
[*]Added more content to flashback tunnel level; 
[*]Fixed anti-aliasing setting; 
[*]Fixed Haruki not showing up at the end; 
[*]Fixed issue loading/saving games; 
[*]Fixed cursor not working when looking at backpack sometimes;
[*]Updated scene transitions; 
[*]Fixed newspaper scene transition; 
[*]Updated the dark figure in the tunnel; 
[*]Tweaked narrative and cameras a little bit; 
[/list]

Thanks for playing! Please let me know if you have any problems or have any thoughts.

All the best,

Larry

Hello there,

This update includes:
[list]
[*] Updated himari journal cover with no translation; 
[*] Updated intro scene with vegetation so it feels nicer; 
[*] Updated nightmare scene with fog and better lighting (and no depth blur); 
[*] Updated spirit realm scene so it feels better; 
[*] Added rope bridge model to the last scene;
[/list]

Thanks again for playing!

Larry

Hello there,

I'm happy to share this is a major update with a bunch of notes:

[list]
[*] Fixed feet drifting on some animations; 
[*] Updated character animation root positions; 
[*] Added more camera interactions to police scene; 
[*] Added animations to burning house; 
[*] Added sad music to a dramatic choice; 
[*] Fixed more haruki animations; 
[*] Fixed appearance of back door in home; 
[*] Fixed oni mask ghosts blinking in and out; 
[*] Removed dramatic sound on Hotel Sanno door; 
[*] Fixed scene change camera issues; 
[*] Fixed a bunch of navigation issues; 
[*] Fixed not being able to get a sunflower; 
[*] Fixed not being able to photograph/record Okiku; 
[*] Added more music to several scenes; 
[*] Updated narrative and things of interest;
[/list]

It's now possible to play the entire game and navigate back and forth if necessary (at least what matches the narrative).

Thanks for playing. Please let me know if you run into any issues.

All the best,

Larry

Hello there,

This build has the following:

[list]
[*] Fixed issues with lighting in various scenes; 
[*] Fixed dancing animation in library; 
[*] Fixed some sound effects/music not playing; 
[*] Updated the introduction scene a little bit; 
[*] Fixed screen flashing black too often; 
[*] Updated some art assets; 
[*] Fixed navigation issues in some levels; 
[*] Fixed issue hiding books/visuals when clicking in empty space instead of Exit; 
